@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Use";
}

<article class="col-lg-9">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Using PadhaiHub</h2>
    <p>PadhaiHub is a free learning platform. Course content, quizzes and discussion posts are provided for educational use. By registering, you agree to use the platform honestly: no spam on the discussion board, and no sharing of your login with others.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Accounts</h2>
    <p>You are responsible for keeping your password private. If you believe your account has been accessed by someone else, contact us straight away so we can help.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Content</h2>
    <p>Lessons and quizzes are written for learning purposes and may contain errors. Discussion posts reflect the views of the member who wrote them, not PadhaiHub.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Changes</h2>
    <p>These terms may be updated as the platform grows. Continuing to use PadhaiHub after a change means you accept the update.</p>
</article>